{"login": "muthyo", "location": null, "commits": [{"sha": "a4802a1553daa0fa4aaa75add20223c06d62f257", "message": "feat: add claude-code via claude-code-nix flake input\n\nReplaces the broken nixpkgs claude-code derivation. Uses\nsadjow/claude-code-nix which tracks upstream releases with pinned hashes\nand disables the auto-updater. Also removes deprecated 'inherit system'\nfrom nixosSystem call.", "created_at": "2026-04-04T08:10:46Z", "repo": "nixos-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3fa53839a5f1e90eeac29728dd7e57480b0a4b30", "message": "fix(apps): remove deprecated nodePackages prefix from language servers\n\nbash-language-server and yaml-language-server moved to top-level in\nnixpkgs.", "created_at": "2026-04-04T08:08:13Z", "repo": "nixos-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "87bfa4b2de722d922d8d4cb6d073f15875cb2bc9", "message": "fix(desktop): enable COSMIC portal for screen capture and streaming\n\nWithout a portals.conf, xdg-desktop-portal never activated\nxdg-desktop-portal-cosmic, leaving only the GTK portal running.\nThe GTK portal doesn't implement ScreenCast, causing vesktop to crash\nwhenever attempting to stream on Wayland.", "created_at": "2026-03-27T20:42:14Z", "repo": "nixos-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "51fbeef8592b892c3104e350fabfd4b7e1d97014", "message": "chore: update .gitignore", "created_at": "2026-03-27T16:46:27Z", "repo": "nixos-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1f520c1605b3a98e54df4052703f64c5ffdfdc28", "message": "docs(readme): remove deleted lib/ from structure tree", "created_at": "2026-03-27T16:19:14Z", "repo": "nixos-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4a6655505979c47faf39e03e9bcba44f0296c225", "message": "fix(home): clean up redundant vim configuration in editors.nix\n\nRemove the xdg.configFile symlink that incorrectly placed .vimrc in\n~/.config/ and the commented-out home.file line. programs.vim with\nextraConfig is the proper home-manager approach and handles it already.", "created_at": "2026-03-27T16:15:18Z", "repo": "nixos-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5d01aee03db6dd3444aab04db5721091a2fee7e6", "message": "fix: remove duplicate and stale module settings\n\n- boot.nix: remove NVIDIA kernel params already defined in nvidia.nix\n- media.nix: remove flatpak enable already set in cosmic.nix\n- nvidia.nix: remove stale GDM wayland setting (COSMIC uses cosmic-greeter)", "created_at": "2026-03-27T16:15:12Z", "repo": "nixos-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3f8ecb2dfb212d48109556e86eeb3e962fd30e9c", "message": "chore: remove unused lib helper functions\n\nlib/default.nix defined optionalModule, enableSoftware, enableHardware,\nand enableServices but none were imported or used anywhere.", "created_at": "2026-03-27T16:15:06Z", "repo": "nixos-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ebcd667f38afefeb715234aabd3d465c62a029f3", "message": "chore: delete legacy pre-flake configuration files\n\nThese root-level files are remnants from before the flake migration\nand are not imported by anything in the current flake setup.\nhardware-configuration.nix is a duplicate of hosts/nixos/hardware-configuration.nix.", "created_at": "2026-03-27T16:15:00Z", "repo": "nixos-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "705628a3f19fc332c3de2bd245cb1cc916fc5eb4", "message": "fix(programs): fix evaluation warnings", "created_at": "2026-03-27T15:52:39Z", "repo": "nixos-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "be53181393627ecde930f930597c5362a04cec4e", "message": "refactor: bump flake", "created_at": "2026-03-27T15:51:59Z"